{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.CcgCosimplicialIdentities","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.CcgCosimplicialIdentities","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ccg_cosimplicial_identities","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ccg_cosimplicial_identities","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/ccg-cosimplicial-identities.lean#L29-L52","doc":"**Cosimplicial identities for the brane-tower CCG.**\n\nThe coface compositions match (at the level invariant) and the\ncodegeneracy compositions match (at the level invariant) — the\ntwo non-trivial cosimplicial relations encoded directly as the\n`coface_coface` and `codegen_codegen` fields of the\n`CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid` structure.\n\nA full statement of the categorical identities (`δʲ ∘ δⁱ = δⁱ ∘\nδʲ⁻¹` for `i < j` etc.) would require richer types for the face\nmaps; this lemma packages the level-based fragment that is\nimmediately discharged from the structure. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:ccg-cosimplicial-identities","label":"def:ccg-cosimplicial-identities","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/ccg-cosimplicial-identities.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}